th a few new screenshots from a scene I’m currently working on.🟡 This might sound like a story from Mr. Ballen, but here it is.I have a friend — or rather, someone close to me — a family man and seemingly a good Christian, who always felt uneasy about my games and my dark/edgy personality. Not disgust, but discomfort with dark themes, borderline","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:42:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3161250-1843481262703742","game_id":"steam-3161250","kind":"announcement","title":"A NEW NIGHTMARE","summary":"Are you ready for more?🟡 First of all, I want to thank you for the engagement on my previous post.🟡 Naturally, this motivates me to start posting here more often. I hope I’ll keep my word, even though I admit my relationship with social media and consistent posting has always been… complicated. That said, today I feel inspired — and more importantly, I finally have more to show you from the new project I’m working on.About the upcoming game🟡 If you’re wondering what the game is called, I’ll keep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T06:42:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703742","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3161250-1842212951305181","game_id":"steam-3161250","kind":"announcement","title":"WHAT GAME IS THIS?","summary":"Hello, my dear friends!🟡 First of all, if you are here, most probably you have already found this game interesting enough to add it to your wishlist. Even more, if you clicked on this announcement, it means that you are already interested in learning more about this project!So, welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T08:32:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305181","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3161250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3161250":"2026-10-26T00:22:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3161250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5355160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
